  stallMessage: Steam and black smoke pour from under the hood. The engine coughs
    and dies.
  limpMessage: It catches again - barely. Nurse it toward town.
  deadMessage: The old motor finally gives out. Red Rock is just ahead - walk the
    rest.
  journalEntry: Grandpa's truck made it most of the way. Ash in the intake, the belt
    squealing, smoke from under the hood - it died at the edge of Red Rock. I walked
    in from there.
